      "content": "The emptiness you feel is a reflection of the deep void left by his absence, and that pain is valid. It's okay to feel like everything has lost its color; grief is a profound loss that changes everything. Instead of focusing on the \"point\" of a future you can't see, maybe focus on simply taking care of the immediate moment. Allow yourself to feel this emptiness without the pressure to fix it right now.",
